  "ig.eye":"Instagram",
  "ig.h":"At work, every day",
  "ig.p":"Leaf, brush and the gilder's hand. Short frames from the workshops and the sites where Manetti gold is at work.",
  "ig.cta":"@manetti_uz",

  /* --- qurilish / dekoratsiya --- */
  "q.eye":"Decoration and architecture",
  "q.h":"Gold<br>on buildings",
  "q.p":"Domes, minarets, facades, interiors, mouldings, columns, iconostases. Manetti gold leaf lasts for decades in sun and rain, never tarnishes and needs no upkeep. We supply building sites, contractors and gilding workshops across Uzbekistan.",
  "q.c1h":"Domes and minarets",
  "q.c1p":"Exterior gilding on metal and stone. Heavier leaf, resistant to ultraviolet light and temperature swings.",
  "q.c2h":"Interiors and mouldings",
  "q.c2p":"Ceilings, cornices, rosettes, carving, columns. Gilding on oil size or on bole, burnished to a mirror.",
  "q.c3h":"Restoration",
  "q.c3p":"Bringing historic gilding back: matching the shade of the existing layer, patina, local repair.",
  "q.t.out":"Exterior work","q.t.in":"Interior","q.t.rest":"Restoration",
  "q.work":"Our work","q.workh":"Projects in Uzbekistan",
  "q.workp":"Frames from the sites and workshops where Manetti gold is at work.",
  "q.why":"Why leaf, not paint",
  "q.whyh":"Paint dulls.<br>Gold does not.",
  "q.whyp1":"Gold paint is only a pigment with metal powder in it: it oxidises, darkens and needs repainting after a few seasons. Gold leaf is pure metal a fraction of a micron thick. It cannot oxidise at all.",
  "q.whyp2":"Outdoors, gilding done properly lasts for decades with no maintenance. That is why domes and spires are gilded, not painted.",
  "q.ask":"Have a project? Send us the area and the type of surface, and we will work out the leaf you need and prepare a quote.",

  /* --- kosmetika --- */
  "k2.eye":"Cosmetic gold",
  "k2.h":"24K gold<br>for the skin",
  "k2.p":"Pure 24K gold leaf for cosmetics: face masks, under-eye patches, salon treatments and cosmetic manufacturing. No fillers, no colouring, no additives — only the metal. The same leaf the Manetti family has made in Florence since 1600.",
  "k2.c1h":"Salons and spas",
  "k2.c1p":"A gold mask over the whole face: a treatment the client remembers and photographs. The leaf is laid on damp skin and lifts off in one piece.",
  "k2.c2h":"The eye area",
  "k2.c2p":"Patches and spot application. The leaf is cut to shape, settles onto the skin and holds together when handled with care.",
  "k2.c3h":"For cosmetic makers",
  "k2.c3p":"Gold as leaf, flakes or powder for creams, serums and masks. We match the format and the quantity to your formulation and supply it with its paperwork.",
  "k2.t.salon":"Salon","k2.t.loc":"Spot","k2.t.leaf":"Leaf","k2.t.b2b":"B2B","k2.t.doc":"Documents",
  "k2.why":"Why real gold",
  "k2.whyh":"The metal itself,<br>not a gold pigment",
  "k2.whyp1":"Gold leaf is pure metal rolled down to a fraction of a micron. Gold is chemically inert: it does not oxidise, it has no smell or taste, and it does not fade. That is why it has been used for centuries wherever the purity of a formulation matters.",
  "k2.whyp2":"The leaf we supply comes off the same production as the restoration and food lines: confirmed origin of the metal, batch traceability and documents with every delivery.",
  "k2.ask":"Working in cosmetics, or making them? Tell us the format and the quantity you need and we will put a price on it.",
  "kb.k":"Cosmetic gold",
  "kb.p":"Face masks, under-eye patches, salon treatments and cosmetic manufacturing. Pure 24K gold, with nothing added.",
  "qb.k":"Architecture and decoration",
  "qb.p":"Domes, minarets, facades, interiors and mouldings. This is the heart of our work in Uzbekistan: gold leaf for building projects and gilding workshops.",
  "qb.t":"Gold<br>on buildings",

  "cta.quote":"Request a price","cta.order":"Order","cta.more":"Find out more",
  "cta.cat":"See the catalogue","cta.gal":"See the gallery","cta.about":"About the house",

  "h.h1":"Giusto Manetti Battiloro,<br>making gold leaf in Florence since 1600",
  "h.sub":"Gold, silver, palladium and platinum in leaf. For the kitchen, for gilding, for restoration. Now in Tashkent.",
  "p1.h":"Catalogue","p1.p":"Do you run a gilding studio, a restoration workshop or a fine-art shop? The B2B catalogue is for those who need gold leaf and gilding materials in volume. We prepare a dedicated quote and help you choose what goes into the order.",
  "p2.h":"E-shop","p2.p":"Are you a chef, a pastry cook or a bartender? Edible 24K gold and silver in leaf, flakes, crumbs and powder. No taste, no scent, approved in the EU as colouring E175. Sold by the piece, no minimum order.",

  "vt.k":"Our showcase","vt.t":"Our<br>showcase",
  "vt.p":"Every month, dedicated offers on a selection of items: gold leaf, mordants, protective coatings, professional tools. We post what is current on Instagram and Telegram.",
  "ac.k":"Gilding Academy","ac.t":"Academy",
  "ac.p":"From the finest gilding craftsmen, a complete guide to the secrets of the trade. When and how to use the different leaf application techniques, which tools to reach for, and how to get a flawless result every time.",
  "gl.k":"Gallery","gl.t":"Gold<br>at work",
  "gl.p":"Paris, New York, London, Dubai: Manetti gold makes made in Italy shine all over the world. Browse the gallery and see it close up.",

  "gc.k":"Edible gold",
  "gc.p":"Powder, crumbs, flakes, leaf: with certified Gold Chef edible gold the plate becomes an occasion. For restaurants, pastry kitchens and bars.",
  "ab.eye":"Since 1600","ab.h":"Fifteen generations<br>of one family",
  "ab.p1":"The Manetti family has kept and renewed the craft of beating precious metals into leaf since 1600: for more than fifteen generations the Manettis have practised the art of the battiloro. Production of gold, silver, palladium and platinum leaf is entirely Made in Italy, at the works in Campi Bisenzio outside Florence.",
  "ab.p2":"Every batch passes a strict quality control: certified non-conflict origin and lot traceability at every stage, from production to sale. Machine technology is joined to the hand knowledge of the craftsmen, and that is the part nobody can copy.",

  "fa.1":"years of craft","fa.2":"generations","fa.3":"countries supplied","fa.4":"shades of leaf",
  "mk.1":"Made in Italy production","mk.2":"Certified gold","mk.3":"Delivery across Uzbekistan","mk.4":"Support at every stage",

  "k.eye":"B2B catalogue","k.h":"Materials<br>for gilding",
  "k.p":"The full set for working with leaf, from preparing the surface to the final protection. Supplied to studios, restorers and fine-art shops.",
  "k.sec.eye":"Six sections of the catalogue","k.sec.h":"A material<br>for every phase",
  "k.sec.p":"The Manetti catalogues follow the steps of the work: leaf, water gilding, oil gilding, finishing, sealing and tools.",
  "k.g1.h":"Leaf and metals","k.g1.p":"Precious metal leaf: gold from 24K to 6K, silver, palladium, platinum — loose and transfer, in books, rolls, powders and shells. And imitation leaf: copper-zinc alloy, aluminium, copper.",
  "k.g2.h":"Water gilding","k.g2.p":"The oldest technique: gilder's gesso, rabbit skin glue and bole. Chosen for icons, restoration and frames: only water gilding, once burnished, gives a glossy, brilliant finish.",
  "k.g3.h":"Oil gilding","k.g3.p":"Gold sizes are adhesives for precious and imitation leaf: water-, alcohol- and oil-based. The quick way to gild smooth, not too porous surfaces, indoors and out.",
  "k.g4.h":"Finishing and patina","k.g4.p":"Mecca varnish, bitumen and bituminous wax give gilding special colour effects, patina and an aged look — over precious and imitation leaf alike.",
  "k.g5.h":"Sealing","k.g5.p":"Shellac and acrylic coatings protect gilding from wear and weather. The product is chosen by the type of leaf, the setting — indoors or outdoors — and the finish you want.",
  "k.g6.h":"Tools","k.g6.p":"Cushion and knife to handle and cut the leaf precisely; gilder's tips, mops and brushes for leaf, sizes and finishes; agate burnishers to bring water gilding to a shine.",
  "k.note":"The exact set and the price depend on the volume. Leave a request and we will prepare an offer for your work.",

