  "cat.p":"The official Giusto Manetti Battiloro catalogues in Italian and English: the full range with photos, formats and codes. Leaf through them right here or download the PDF.",
  "cat.gmb.s":"The general catalogue: precious and imitation metal leaf, water and oil gilding, finishing, sealing, tools and the Kölner line.",
  "cat.ba.s":"The Belle Arti line, created in 2022 for students, hobbyists and professionals: leaf in single booklets, a frame gilding kit, sizes, finishes, sealing and tools.",
